**What's in place:** Compute culling fills DrawIndexed records and per-group counts for opaque and mask items, plus skinned items. Each group is one `ExecuteIndirect` on DX12 or one `vkCmdDrawIndexedIndirectCount` on Vulkan. The indexed path is the fallback. `tests/src/render_indirect_gpu_tests.cpp` covers the golden scene against the indexed path, culling disabled, group overflow, an empty frame, and skinned draws with motion vectors.

